OL,3,CMan, 102, in critical condition in
OL,4,Chospital after alleged pub assault
OL,6,FA 102-year-old man is in a critical
OL,7,Fcondition in hospital after an alleged
OL,8,Fassault at a pub in Cwmbran.
OL,10,FThe man suffered serious injuries at
OL,11,FThe Crow's Nest pub on Llangorse Road
OL,12,Fon Saturday (1 August) evening. Police
OL,13,Fwere called, alongside paramedics, at
OL,14,Faround 10:30pm.
OL,16,FA 56-year-old man from Llanelli has
OL,17,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of section
OL,18,F20 assault and has since been released
OL,19,Funder investigation.
