OL,3,CMan, 102, in critical condition in
OL,4,Chospital after alleged pub assault
OL,6,FGwent Police are appealing for
OL,7,Finformation from witnesses and a
OL,8,Fspokesperson said: "Enquiries are
OL,9,Fongoing and we are asking anyone who
OL,10,Fwas in the pub between 10pm and 11pm
OL,11,Fon Saturday, August 1, to contact us.
OL,13,F"If you have not yet spoken to the
OL,14,Fpolice, you can contact us by calling
OL,15,F101, sending a direct message on
OL,16,Fsocial media, or via the form on our
OL,17,Fwebsite, quoting log reference
OL,18,F2600249432."
